t you  can start with five minutes or even just  a couple of minutes of deep breathing  and slowly build that up it's time to  take my big babies for their morning  walk  I'll take them around my neighborhood  for about 20 to 30 minutes they always  have way too much energy and they need  lots of exercise this also gets me  moving and having them with me just  lights up my morning they bring so much  joy to my home as much as I can  I prefer exercising in the morning  because it makes me feel more energized  throughout the day it doesn't have to be  an intense workout the goal is to get  your body moving and blood flowing plus  I like to start my day knowing that I  don't have to worry about being too busy  to miss a workout it doesn't matter what  time of the day you work out what's most  important is that you find a time that  suits your lifestyle where you're more  likely to stay consistent and stick to  your routine time to feed my muscles and  have breakfast I don't like to be  fussing about in the kitchen so I like  to keep things simple I've made some  overnight oats of the day before all I  have to do is top it up with some fresh  fruits nuts and seeds at breakfast I  would also write a microd food journal  three things I'm grateful for what would  make today amazing and my affirmation  for the day for example  I'm grateful for my friends and family  my team and you I would also use this  time to make a list of what I ain't  accomplished for today this is a good  way to start my day focused and knowing  exactly what my goals are having a  physical list instead of a mental one is  more productive as it gives you the  satisfaction of crossing out something  once it's done plus it ensures that you  won't forget anything important  let's get to work what do I listen to  when I'm driving audible  I'm currently listening to the power of  vulnerability and it has helped with my  personal growth audible has an unmatched  number of audiobooks that you can listen  to 